  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      261.29,
      401.79,
      284.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      296.33,
      401.87,
      331.07
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Termination ofEmployment of Workmen (Special Provisions)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      343.13,
      401.88,
      389.63
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Termination of Employment ofWorkmen (Special Provisions) Act, No. 45 of 1971 is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof, by the repeal of paragraph(c) and the substitution therefore of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      191.37,
      401.69,
      401.9,
      459.95
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c)to the termination of employment of anyworkman where such termination was effectedupon such workman attains the minimumretirement age as specified in the MinimumRetirement Age of Workers Act, No. of 2021;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      472.61,
      401.89,
      507.95
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
